  "summary": "Cobblestone Jazz is a Canadian trio based in Victoria, British Columbia, known for their jazz improvisation-influenced approach to making electronic music. The band has been described as \"a 21st century jam band, a 'Plastikman-meets-the-Grateful Dead' juggernaut.\" The band consists of Mathew Jonson, Danuel Tate, and Tyger Dhula. Together with regular collaborator The Mole, the group has also performed as The Modern Deep Left Quartet.",
